 flex flex-col justify-between grow\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"bg-white text-slate-700 text-[10px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-slate-200/80\">INSTITUTIONAL NEWS</span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 font-bold text-xs\">December 15, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-4 group-hover:text-emerald-900 transition-colors\">IRITAQ Forms Landmark Academic Partnership with the Syed Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal Consortium</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">This historic agreement paves the way for joint international symposia, shared digital databases of ancient manuscripts, and scholar exchange programs starting in early 2027.</p></div><div><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><span>Read Full Article</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between h-full hover:border-emerald-200 transition\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-[#c78828] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">RESEARCH NEWS</span><span class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs font-medium\">Nov 28, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-3\">Pioneering AI Arabic Text Analysis Model Released for Public Peer Review</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-