&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnews%2Fai-presentation.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md text-slate-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xs\">ANNOUNCEMENT</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800 mb-2\"><span>Aug 14, 2026</span><span>•</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">By Media Center</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-900 transition-colors\">Webinar Scheduled: AI&#x27;s Integration into Islamic Studies</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Join our Digital Humanities experts as they present live case studies demonstrating correct workflows fo...</p></div></div><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 pt-0\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><span>Read More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-[#f8f5ee] border-y border-amber-200/60 py-16 px-6 md:px-16 mt-20\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">NEWSLETTER</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-light mb-4\">Subscribe to Our Newsletter</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-8\">Get quarterly digests of the latest peer-reviewed research, announcements, and critical commentary delivered straight to your inbox.</p><form class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 w-full max-w-md\"><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\" class=\"w-full bg-white text-slate-800 text-xs px-5 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-700 shadow-2xs\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#2d7355] hover:bg-[#235b43] text-white text-xs font-bold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-xs shrink-0 cursor-pointer\">Subscribe</button></form></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">PRESS RELEASES</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-light\">Official Press Releases</h2></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200/80 border-t border-b border-slate-200/80\"><div class=\"py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition px-2 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold block\">November 10, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-normal\">IRITAQ Announces Expansion of Digital Archive with Over 5,000 Rare Manuscripts Added</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">In a collaborative effort with Egypt and Morocco libraries, IRITAQ digitizes and categorizes historical commentaries for online open access.</p></div><div class=\"shrink-0\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-emerald-800/80 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-800 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition cursor-pointer\"><span>Read Full Release</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition px-2 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold block\">October 01, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-normal\">Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya Appoints Dr. Omar Al-Suyuti as New Dean of Academic Affairs</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">Dr. Al-Suyuti&#x27;s legacy in textual preservation and Arabic linguistics will lead the newly structured interdisciplinary studies department.</p></div><div class=\"shrink-0\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-emerald-800/80 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-800 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition cursor-pointer\"><span>Read Full Release</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition px-2 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold block\">September 15, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-normal\">International Symposium on Tafsir Methodologies Set to Launch in London this December</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">Scholars, computational researchers, and translators will converge to debate standardization guidelines in contemporary digital translation.</p></div><div class=\"shrink-0\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-emerald-800/80 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-800 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition cursor-pointer\"><span>Read Full Release</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-[#f8f5ee] border-t border-amber-200/60 py-16 px-6 md:px-16 mt-20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">CONFERENCE NEWS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-light\">Highlights from Recent Events</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative aspect-3/4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group border border-slate-800/20 shadow-md bg-slate-950 flex flex-col justify-end p-5 text-white cursor-pointer\"><img alt=\"International Qur&#x27;anic Studies Conference\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 opacity-80\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnews%2Fconf-mosque-night.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnews%2Fconf-mos